\" y1=\"147.70114942528735\" x2=\"412\" y2=\"147.70114942528735\" stroke-dasharray=\"2,3\"/><polyline class=\"chart-line\" points=\"59.426187050359715,303.4388489208633 96.88942857142857,220.8 172.36483870967737,188.25806451612905 263.41194805194806,164.54545454545456 340.9854545454545,106.24242424242425 407.6314893617021,48.978723404255334\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2.4\"/><g class=\"pt\" data-tip=\"Forecast said 0%&amp;#10;It rained 22% of the time&amp;#10;Based on 139 days&amp;#10;outside the perfect-forecast range - real miscalibration\"><circle class=\"chart-dot sig\" cx=\"59.426187050359715\" cy=\"303.4388489208633\" r=\"6.5\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></g><g class=\"pt\" data-tip=\"Forecast said 11%&amp;#10;It rained 44% of the time&amp;#10;Based on 70 days&amp;#10;outside the perfect-forecast range - real miscalibration\"><circle class=\"chart-dot sig\" cx=\"96.88942857142857\" cy=\"220.8\" r=\"6.5\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></g><g class=\"pt\" data-tip=\"Forecast said 32%&amp;#10;It rained 53% of the time&amp;#10;Based on 62 days&amp;#10;outside the perfect-forecast range - real miscalibration\"><circle class=\"chart-dot sig\" cx=\"172.36483870967737\" cy=\"188.25806451612905\" r=\"6.5\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></g><g class=\"pt\" data-tip=\"Forecast said 58%&amp;#10;It rained 60% of the time&amp;#10;Based on 77 days&amp;#10;within the range a perfect forecast would give\"><circle class=\"chart-dot\" cx=\"263.41194805194806\" cy=\"164.54545454545456\" r=\"6.5\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></g><g class=\"pt\" data-tip=\"Forecast said 80%&amp;#10;It rained 76% of the time&amp;#10;Based on 66 days&amp;#10;within the range a perfect forecast would give\"><circle class=\"chart-dot\" cx=\"340.9854545454545\" cy=\"106.24242424242425\" r=\"6.5\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></g><g class=\"pt\" data-tip=\"Forecast said 99%&amp;#10;It rained 91% of the time&amp;#10;Based on 282 days&amp;#10;outside the perfect-forecast range - real miscalibration\"><circle class=\"chart-dot sig\" cx=\"407.6314893617021\" cy=\"48.978723404255334\" r=\"6.5\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></g><text class=\"chart-label\" x=\"235.0\" y=\"422\" font-size=\"12.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\">What the forecast promised</text><text class=\"chart-label\" x=\"15\" y=\"200.0\" font-size=\"12.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\" transform=\"rotate(-90 15 200.0)\">How often it actually rained</text></svg>\n<figcaption>Green band = where a <b>flawless</b> forecast would still land, given\nhow few days we have. Red dots fall outside it, so those are real errors rather\nthan noise. The faint horizontal line is climatology\n(64%).</figcaption></figure>\n","season":"\n<h2 id=\"season\">Does the season matter?</h2>\n<p>In Belfast the forecast is most skilful in\n<b>spring</b> (0.38) and least in\n<b>winter</b> (-0.16).</p>\n<div class=\"tablewrap\">\n<table><thead><tr><th>Season</th><th class=\"num\">Days</th>\n<th class=\"num\">Rain days</th><th class=\"num\">Skill score</th>\n<th class=\"num\">Avg error</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>winter</td><td class='num'>175</td><td class='num'>77%</td><td class='num'>-0.163</td><td class='num'>17.6%</td></tr><tr><td>autumn</td><td class='num'>150</td><td class='num'>73%</td><td class='num'>-0.059</td><td class='num'>19.9%</td></tr><tr><td>summer</td><td class='num'>154</td><td class='num'>61%</td><td class='num'>0.307</td><td class='num'>12.5%</td></tr><tr><td>spring</td><td class='num'>217</td><td class='num'>51%</td><td class='num'>0.377</td><td class='num'>10.0%</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<p class=\"muted\">Four-way splits of a two-year record are thin, so read the\nordering as indicative. Coarser binning is used here than for the annual curve\nfor the same reason.</p>\n"},"lat":54.59682,"lon":-5.92541,"n":696,"n_cities":134,"name":"Belfast","offset_days":0,"pop_map":[{"hi":0.04,"lo":0.0,"mean":0.004028776978417267,"n":139,"obs":0.2158273381294964,"sig":true},{"hi":0.23000000000000057,"lo":0.04,"mean":0.10985714285714283,"n":70,"obs":0.44285714285714284,"sig":tr